## 1. Portal Architecture Overview

Ankelba has **three role-specific portals** under a single web app, each reached after login:

| Portal | Primary Users | Entry Point |
|---|---|---|
| **Admin Portal** | Daycare Administrator | `/admin/dashboard` |
| **Caregiver Portal** | Caregiver / Teacher | `/caregiver/dashboard` |
| **Parent Portal** | Parent / Guardian | `/parent/dashboard` |

All portals share: a global **Navbar** (role-aware), a **Notification Bell**, and a **User Menu** (profile + logout).

