> 🍽️ **Meal Suggestions — Care Instructions Tab Enhancement**  
> The "Care Instructions" tab captures allergies and dietary notes. This data is passed as context to the AI Parent Guide (§5.6) when generating meal suggestions. Admins clearly flag:
> - Known food allergies (e.g., peanut allergy, lactose intolerance)
> - Dietary restrictions (e.g., vegetarian, no pork)
> - Preferred foods or dislikes noted by parents  
