## 7. Meal Suggestion Integration Summary

> [!NOTE]
> Meal suggestions are **not a standalone page** — they are woven throughout the app where meal context is already present. The table below gives a consolidated overview of all touch points.

| Location | Type | Audience | Details |
|---|---|---|---|
| **AI Parent Guide** `/parent/ai-guide` | Full AI-powered meal suggestions with personalization | Parent | Primary hub: allergen-aware, age-appropriate, culturally relevant meal ideas via chat + Quick Chips + Meal Cards |
| **Parent Dashboard** `/parent/dashboard` | Quick shortcut | Parent | "🍽️ Meal Ideas" button in Quick Links → pre-loads AI Guide with meal prompt |
| **Daily Report Detail** `/parent/reports` | Contextual bridge | Parent | "💡 Get dinner ideas based on today's meals" deep-links AI Guide with today's meal data as context |
| **Messages/Announcements** `/parent/messages` | Daycare weekly meal plan | Parent | "Meal Plans" sub-tab shows admin-published weekly meal schedule |
| **Caregiver Dashboard** `/caregiver/dashboard` | Today's meal suggestion widget | Caregiver | Admin-defined daily/weekly meal plan shown as reference for report filling |
| **Daily Report Form** `/caregiver/report/new` | Meal suggestion assist | Caregiver | "💡 Suggest Meal" button in Meals & Snacks section; pulls from daycare meal plan, allergy-filtered |
| **Child Profile** `/admin/children/:id` | Data source | Admin | Allergy & dietary notes captured here feed the AI allergy guard; no suggestions generated here |
| **Admin Communication** `/admin/communication` | Meal plan publishing | Admin | Admin publishes weekly meal plan as a special announcement type visible to all parents |
| **Daycare Store** `/parent/store` | Product category bridge | Parent | "Snacks & Nutritional Supplies" category; AI Guide may reference store items in suggestions |
| **Parent Profile** `/parent/profile` | Personalization data | Parent | Optional food preference fields personalize AI meal suggestions in the household context |

